Midgard is a sovereign, post-quantum, in-enclosure platform suite. Its
open-source core — the crypto (pqc-agility, pq-mtls, policy, audit-writer),
services (fabric, iam, kms, governance, gateway, http-gateway, scheduler,
telemetry), Forge, Mimir, Bifrost, Heimdall, the Admin control plane, the
client platform crates, and the supply-chain tools — is distributed under
Apache-2.0. Commercial tiers (see veldris.io) are operated and maintained by
Veldris Ltd. and may include additional, separately-licensed components.

