Post-quantum cryptography implements the NIST FIPS 203 (ML-KEM), FIPS 204
(ML-DSA), and FIPS 205 (SLH-DSA) standards; AES-256-GCM per FIPS 197. See
docs/compliance/COMPLIANCE_MATRIX.md for the full standards mapping.
